 "_note": "Original Mika World creatures (procedural meshes, no external assets). They roam the Sanctuary's wild edges; the ritual circle's ward keeps them out (ward_radius from the circle's centre). tier: weak | medium | rare. hp in 'spell units' (a novice Arcane Orb deals ~0.55 x damage x 100). resist: element -> multiplier (missing = 1). attack: what they do to a mage's vigor (stamina, never death). loot: dropped as physical pickups the mage has to collect. stagger_s: how long a creature reels after being struck (no moving or attacking), which gives a caster time between spells. Milestone J: creatures with a 'body' and an 'attacks' list fight with telegraphed attacks (windup -> strike -> recover), stamina, poise (a hit of at least poise x max hp interrupts a windup), 'exposed_mult' extra damage during the recovery window, and flyers that keep their distance ('keep_at'), strafe and retreat once when badly hurt ('retreat_below'). body.type: sentinel (original articulated stone golem, tools/models/build_sentinel.py) | clip (an animated GLB, see docs/ASSET_SOURCES.md).",
